abstract: "Per-symbol earnings-reaction base rates for 524 US-listed companies: priced-print counts, hit rates at the ±2/3/5/8/10% thresholds, median absolute move, and largest observed up/down moves. Derived statistics from the ISA-01 Earnings-Move Atlas, data as of 2026-10-23."
